Out-of-order execution enabled deep reinforcement learning for dynamic additive manufacturing scheduling
Mingyue Sun a, Jiyuchen Ding b, Zhiheng Zhao a,b,c,∗, Jian Chen d, George Q. Huang a,b, Lihui Wang e
a Department of Industrial and Systems Engineering, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, Hong Kong, China b Research Institute for Advanced Manufacturing, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, Hong Kong, China c State Key Laboratory of Intelligent Manufacturing Equipment and Technology, Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan, China d Department of Economics and Management, Nanjing University of Aeronautics and Astronautics, Nanjing, China e Department of Production Engineering, KTH Royal Institute of Technology, Sweden
